flecting same time/place): on warehousing, residence, river vessels, furs, packaging and sealing goods, transit points on number of people with goods, on foreign merchants, at customs office, transit tax often for the Church, bridge toll, other transit taxes, tax on goods sent to other Russian towns, selling cattle, length of river vessels, on weighing bulk goods, punitive taxes for avoiding tax or dues, taxes on being with a caravan, on transit travellers, on wholesale goods, on ships, on sacks, tax based on price of goods sold.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 909, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 747})
